 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "8ac638a5-aa67-52ca-af4f-6608fc3d74fd",
   "name": "About",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -40,
    -380
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Personalised UK ILG orders: VAS check (every 30 min)\nUK ILG shipments created in the last `lookbackHours` (1) whose order has a PERSONALISE_1_3 / PERSONALISE_4_12 line must have ILG Order Class = Ecom VAS. Not yet sent to ILG: set it (guarded sub-workflow) and read back. Already sent: alert once. Old orders are not looked at (Ben: they are sorted).\n\n**TEMPORARY band-aid** (Ben 27-Oct-26): the Fulfil automation rule reads the 'Personalised' SO comment, which Shopify Flow adds after import, so it can miss. Remove once Fulfil fixes the rule.\n\nIDs are looked up by code/name, so the same flow works on SANDBOX and PROD. Go-live (Diviyaj): Settings tenant/baseUrl = PROD, read nodes to Fulfil PROD credential, dryRun false, allowProdWrite true, lookbackHours 1. PROD emails go to emailToProd.",
    "width": 620,
    "height": 380
   }
  },
